L2: Is restarts cumulative or per interval?

timeseries r = sum(dt.kubernetes.container.restarts),
           by:{k8s.namespace.name, k8s.workload.name, last_exit_code}, from:-24h
| filter startsWith(k8s.namespace.name, "app")
| fieldsAdd apmid = upper(substring(k8s.namespace.name, from:0, to:11)),
            clean = arrayRemoveNulls(r)
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
| fieldsAdd first = arrayFirst(clean), last = arrayLast(clean), peak = arrayMax(clean)
| fields apmid, workload = k8s.workload.name, last_exit_code, first, last, peak
| sort peak desc
| limit 15


If last equals peak and is at or above first, the metric is a running total. If the values bounce around, it's a per-interval count.

