L4: Active "Deployment stuck" problems by app

fetch dt.davis.problems, from:-30d
| sort timestamp desc
| dedup display_id
| filter event.status == "ACTIVE" and dt.davis.is_duplicate == false
| filter event.name == "Deployment stuck"
| expand tag = entity_tags
| filter startsWith(tag, "APMID:")
| fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1]
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
| summarize active = countDistinctExact(display_id),
            oldest = min(event.start), newest = max(event.start),
            by:{apmid}
| sort active desc


This shows which apps are affected and how old the problems are. Many non-prod deployments sit stuck for weeks, so a stale problem is a cleanup item, not a new incident. That decides whether 7.1 counts it as Critical or only Warning.

